WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.200
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.267
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.634
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:05.801
And now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:07.934
President Biden today,
traveled to Florida

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:10.067
and spoke about
Social Security and Medicare.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.534
He didn't intend to, it's just
what everybody in Florida

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:13.934
was already talking about.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:15.534
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:17.734
Democratic Congressman
James Clyburn praised

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:19.434
President Biden's
State of the Union performance

00:00:19.434 --> 00:00:20.734
yesterday.

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:23.334
And said Biden displayed, quote,
"The kind of maturity

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:25.868
that the American people would
like to see in a president."

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:28.434
When you say maturity,
you mean this guy?

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.200
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.734
You're talking about this guy?

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:35.534
I think that's the maturity you
expect from your cool uncle.

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.334
"Hey, hop in kid.

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:38.667
We're gonna go to
Dave and Busters.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.601
I got a bucket
full of quarters."

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:43.467
Senator majority leader
Chuck Schumer praised

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.968
President Biden yesterday
for baiting Republicans

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:48.968
into a bi-partisan agenda during
the State of the Union address

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:51.767
and said, quote, "He let
them walk into his trap."

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.734
That might be a little generous.

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:55.467
It's more like
when someone falls

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.801
running away from Michael Myers.

00:00:56.801 --> 00:00:58.801
Was it a trap?

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.000
Or did Michael Myers
just get lucky?"

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.601
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:05.734
That's right, Schumer said Biden
let them walk into his trap

00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:08.901
while Marjorie Taylor Greene
let a seal walk into hers.

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:17.200
Georgia Congresswoman Marjorie
Taylor Greene

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.434
yesterday defended her
heckling of President Biden

00:01:19.434 --> 00:01:20.934
during the State of the Union
and said,

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.934
quote, "I don't clap for liars."

00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:25.567
Well, whatever she claps for,
it's definitely on the

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:26.934
ones and threes.

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:31.300
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.033
You know what?
For the people who got it,

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.367
I think they're gonna
like it a great deal.

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:35.634
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.667
Do I think both you and I,
knew baze that wasn't

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:40.634
for everybody,
but for the people it was for --

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:41.567
Fred, did you like it?

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:44.200
-Oh yes.
-Yeah, there you go, see?

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.734
Some of these jokes
are for drummers.

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:47.968
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:47.968 --> 00:01:49.467
North Korean leader
Kim Jong Un

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:51.834
was joined on stage yesterday
by his 9-year-old daughter

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:55.000
at a military parade unveiling
the country's new missiles.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.300
So, I guess
bring-your-daughter-to-work day

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.067
has officially
jumped the shark.

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:02.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.167
New York Congressman Nick Lalota
Referred to fellow

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:06.100
Republican representative
George Santos during

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.701
an interview yesterday as
a, quote, "sociopath,"

00:02:08.701 --> 00:02:11.968
which ironically is the only
thing not on his resume.

00:02:11.968 --> 00:02:14.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:17.400
Ukrainian President Zelenskyy
met with King Charles yesterday

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.434
at Buckingham palace.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:21.200
"How's the war going,"
asked Zelenskyy.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:27.501
[ Applause ]

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:40.267
Fire fighters in -- we should
say right now -- you know what,

00:02:40.267 --> 00:02:43.701
this joke is very dependent
on a graphic.

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:45.100
We haven't seen it yet.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.334
We're gonna find out in real
time if this joke pays off.

00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:51.267
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:51.267 --> 00:02:53.534
I think in the writing of the
joke,

00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:55.400
he had a very clear idea
of what it was gonna look like,

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.734
and now we're gonna find out.

00:02:58.734 --> 00:03:01.400
Fire fighters in Pennsylvania
were recently called to remove

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.901
a cake pan that got stuck
on a girl's head.

00:03:03.901 --> 00:03:07.400
And right before picture day.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:10.400
[ Awe's and laughter ]

00:03:16.234 --> 00:03:18.734
[ Laughter continues ]

00:03:23.467 --> 00:03:25.634
I guess you can win them all.

00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:27.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:30.467
And finally, authorities in
Texas arrested a man this week

00:03:30.467 --> 00:03:32.834
who they believe broke into the
Dallas zoo

00:03:32.834 --> 00:03:34.300
and stole two monkeys.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.167
Though when reached for comment,
the man was, you guessed it,

00:03:37.167 --> 00:03:40.300
already busted out
by two monkeys.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:42.000
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.100
We got...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.300
a great show
for you tonight.

